    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656840/extras/ee1d92f7a8c79f9e229edaab6d085815.poster.avif?t=1641885982\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656840/extras/ee1d92f7a8c79f9e229edaab6d085815.webm?t=1641885982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656840/extras/ee1d92f7a8c79f9e229edaab6d085815.mp4?t=1641885982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You found yourself on your life path, running from everything, looking for something, dying for nothing.<br>Death Maze is all about you. It\u2019s a game.. is it?<br><br><i><strong>Death Maze</strong> - fast-paced hardcore arcade game about getting out of the maze. <br>There are no winners - maze will get us all. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Multiple mazes, each has its demon, secrets and new challenges.<br></li><li> Get to the top ladder in world-wide and local leaderboards. Faster - better.<br></li><li> Fast rhythmic soundtracks. <br></li><li> Full controller suppport.<br></li><li> Steam achievements &amp; trading cards (coming soon)</li></ul></i>",
